  "notes": [
    "Review images reuse exact runtime source textures and current fixture atlas cells. No original artwork changed.",
    "Centerlines own movement; displayed clear bands are diagnostic aids only.",
    "Focused transcripts cover their named checks. They do not grant full-suite, device, human or game-wide acceptance.",
    "The pool reconciliation inherits source 64094fca; the atlas still contains 34 Opera views and 13 Castle rooms, not a new pool-activity capture packet.",
    "Back-arrow reconciliation inherits dev a6ffa14d. The atlas reproduces stage geometry and fixtures; it is not a capture of the persistent global navigation overlay. The first combined-parent voice failure and rechecks are recorded separately.",
    "Current dev 763a0213 introduces the Chapter 2 lawn. It is inventoried as a 65th open entry; no lawn geometry reproduction or acceptance is implied by the Castle/Opera atlas.",
    "Clearance section at bad0e919 replaces ten generic Castle networks. Pool is a declared swim network; Movie Lounge has 16px floor-foot clearance. The three previously authored rooms retain zero positive margin evidence. No full silhouette acceptance implied."
  ],
